>>>>>> round 13, the player: "Easy, Ged, you've done well to last this long. Here, drink," I say, handing him my waterskin, "and then tell me what's down in the deep workings: where Bram is now, and how far. Can you walk if I get you out? I've got Olin's spare lantern, and I'll keep both lights burning all the way up."

